 of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids August to September came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those 75 years. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 40% of normal in February to March and 54% of normal in August to September. Grid 23540 had its driest year in 1988, at 45% of normal.</p>"}
